--- follow-ups (non-blocking) ---
1. a WAIT from a client that never wrote never blocks (velo answers the replica count synchronously, redis blocks until the deadline)
2. the replica-role check is not first (redis checks server.masterhost before parsing the arguments)
3. OneSlot.delayRun() silently drops the task when slotWorkerEventloop == null -> the poller deadline is never armed -> the client hangs forever
4. countDistinctReplicas() counts configured replicas, not online ones (redis counts SLAVE_STATE_ONLINE only)
